WEBVTT

00:09.390 --> 00:11.183
<i>This is Morioh Radio.</i>

00:11.434 --> 00:15.104
<i>Kai Harada, here, keeping you
company on this fine day.</i>

00:15.563 --> 00:16.313
<i>Now..</i>

00:16.397 --> 00:19.316
Just look at those spokes
sparkle and spin!

00:19.734 --> 00:22.445
I can't believe I got
this mountain bike for graduation!

00:22.987 --> 00:25.239
Getting new stuff is
so much fun!

00:25.740 --> 00:29.326
I'm not gonna be able to give this up
for the school bus anytime soon!

00:43.090 --> 00:45.092
O-Ow…

00:45.468 --> 00:47.261
Wh-What the heck?

00:47.720 --> 00:49.847
What's a bag doing
in the middle of the street?

00:54.518 --> 00:57.562
No, it can't be!
That bag had a…

01:01.567 --> 01:04.653
Oh-Oh my god!
I just ran it over!

01:04.945 --> 01:06.655
I couldn't swerve in time!

01:06.781 --> 01:08.157
It was right in my path!

01:08.449 --> 01:09.783
I didn't even see it!

01:10.159 --> 01:11.201
You got it.

01:12.203 --> 01:14.163
It wasn't your fault.

01:14.580 --> 01:16.623
Just an unfortunate accident.

01:17.958 --> 01:19.960
The guy who shoved
a little kitten in a bag

01:20.044 --> 01:23.881
and left it to die in the street
is the real scoundrel.

01:24.173 --> 01:26.341
Pretty rotten if you ask me.

01:28.010 --> 01:29.177
W-We've got to do something!

01:29.470 --> 01:30.929
What's the point?

01:31.138 --> 01:32.931
Do you hear any meowing?

01:33.683 --> 01:35.184
It's dead.

01:36.352 --> 01:37.269
What's your name?

01:37.978 --> 01:40.063
I'm Tamami Kobayashi.

01:40.147 --> 01:42.899
I graduated from your school
two years ago.

01:44.318 --> 01:46.069
Nice bike ya got there.

01:46.779 --> 01:48.030
You a freshman?

01:48.197 --> 01:51.658
Y-Yes. My name's
Koichi Hirose.

01:51.992 --> 01:55.328
Ah, that takes me back.
High school…

01:55.705 --> 01:57.498
Those were the days.

01:57.665 --> 02:00.918
Well, have a seat over here,
Mr. Hirose.

02:01.168 --> 02:03.211
Eh? B-But…

02:04.213 --> 02:08.050
Quit quivering…
I said sit your ass down!

02:09.135 --> 02:12.763
Now…
I have a proposition for you.

02:13.347 --> 02:15.932
I'll lay that pussycat to rest,

02:16.183 --> 02:18.685
and you dish out a little cash.
Sound fair?

02:19.729 --> 02:22.356
Hey! Something wrong
with your ears?!

02:22.565 --> 02:24.024
Wh-What are you talking ab—

02:24.191 --> 02:26.193
Hey, now.
This is serious business.

02:26.527 --> 02:27.903
Of course, you're innocent,

02:28.070 --> 02:29.821
but you're not planning on
just walking off

02:29.905 --> 02:31.823
after killing my cat,
are you?

02:32.616 --> 02:34.284
It was your cat?

02:34.452 --> 02:36.203
That's what I said.

02:36.954 --> 02:40.082
Y-You were the one who stuck
the kitten o-over there?

02:40.249 --> 02:42.960
That's not the point.

02:43.210 --> 02:44.628
I'm asking if you really think

02:44.712 --> 02:46.338
you're gonna just walk away
scot free.

02:46.589 --> 02:48.424
After all, the killer here…

02:49.049 --> 02:50.550
is you, kiddo!

03:07.610 --> 03:09.903
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

03:11.113 --> 03:14.449
<i>These faceless gazes pass by one another</i>

03:14.784 --> 03:18.120
<i>A wound to the heart changes our everyday</i>

03:18.329 --> 03:22.829
<i>Encounters without boundaries
The bizarre is our normal U-yeh</i>

03:25.294 --> 03:28.630
<i>These ordinary mornings,
we're laughing on the surface</i>

03:28.714 --> 03:32.342
<i>Mysteries drawn to each other,
identity still unknown</i>

03:32.426 --> 03:36.926
<i>Without a heads up,
it's quietly lurking somewhere in this town</i>

03:41.519 --> 03:46.019
<i>Although we bicker and complain
In the end, we celebrate</i>

03:48.567 --> 03:51.945
<i>Dancing through the everyday</i>

03:52.029 --> 03:56.529
<i>Crazy Noisy Bizarre Town</i>

04:08.337 --> 04:12.674
EPISODE 6
KOICHI HIROSE (REVERB)

04:08.671 --> 04:11.298
So, feeling a little guilty, huh?

04:11.549 --> 04:12.696
If paying a little fee

04:13.384 --> 04:17.221
could free you from
that oppressive feeling of guilt…

04:17.596 --> 04:20.682
Wouldn't it be easier
to just fork over some cash?

04:21.016 --> 04:21.850
Right?

04:26.313 --> 04:28.273
MONEY

04:29.024 --> 04:32.527
Wh-What the heck is
this lock thing?!

04:33.863 --> 04:34.613
It's so heavy!

04:34.864 --> 04:37.408
Huh? You can see it?

04:39.118 --> 04:42.579
Then this'll be a snap,
Hirose!

04:42.997 --> 04:45.082
Th-This thing's a Stand?!

04:45.583 --> 04:49.420
A Stand's stuck inside
my body?!

04:51.171 --> 04:52.505
Hey, Josuke.

04:52.882 --> 04:56.260
Look over there…
Isn't that Koichi?

04:56.385 --> 04:59.054
Yep, that sure looks like
Koichi to me.

04:59.805 --> 05:03.391
That guy always seems to
end up with the wrong crowd.

05:03.809 --> 05:05.769
It doesn't look like
he's having a bad time.

05:06.353 --> 05:07.520
Ya know,

05:07.605 --> 05:10.733
I met this guy Keicho Nijimura
'bout four months ago,

05:11.108 --> 05:13.401
and ended up with
a pretty handy skill.

05:13.694 --> 05:15.612
Hadn't a clue what the hell
was happening,

05:15.696 --> 05:16.947
but it sure made me happy.

05:17.031 --> 05:19.491
I figured
if I put it to good use,

05:19.575 --> 05:22.202
I'd be set for
the rest of my life.

05:22.620 --> 05:23.329
Now…

05:23.412 --> 05:24.704
Come on,
cough it up.

05:25.247 --> 05:29.167
Be cheap, and
this lock is gonna stay put!

05:29.752 --> 05:31.295
I-I don't…

05:31.837 --> 05:33.630
have any money.

05:33.797 --> 05:36.800
Huh… I thought
I just saw you look away.

05:37.217 --> 05:39.427
W-Well…

05:41.555 --> 05:42.973
This weight!

05:43.182 --> 05:45.017
I can't bear the weight!

05:45.726 --> 05:47.269
Tsk, tsk, tsk.

05:47.728 --> 05:50.021
It's bad to lie, you know.

05:50.272 --> 05:53.608
You lied and you know it,
am I right?

05:53.901 --> 05:57.863
The guiltier you feel,
the bigger the lock grows.

05:58.030 --> 06:00.615
This lock here is proportional
to the weight of your misdeed.

06:00.783 --> 06:02.451
The two are inextricably linked.

06:02.743 --> 06:05.871
Whether I'm sound asleep,
or you're running far away,

06:05.955 --> 06:07.706
that thing isn't coming off.

06:08.123 --> 06:10.875
Okay? So be a good boy,
and show me your wallet.

06:11.085 --> 06:11.919
Come on.

06:12.836 --> 06:15.839
Hey, you were
holding out on me.

06:15.923 --> 06:18.467
This looks like
7,000 yen to me!

06:18.717 --> 06:22.929
Th-That's my sneaker money
for gym class today!

06:23.097 --> 06:24.598
Sneakers?

06:26.100 --> 06:27.726
You can go barefoot!

06:28.185 --> 06:30.437
What you up to, dude?

06:33.732 --> 06:35.900
J-Josuke and Okuyasu!

06:36.151 --> 06:39.696
Looks like a grown man's mugging
a little high school kid.

06:39.947 --> 06:41.907
Go get a job and
earn your own money.

06:42.157 --> 06:45.326
You know, little boys like
you should really stay out of this.

06:45.619 --> 06:47.704
Sorry, no can do.

06:47.788 --> 06:49.748
Not when there's a
stinkin' shit bag and

06:49.832 --> 06:51.500
his dirty little Stand
in front of me.

06:51.792 --> 06:54.377
I think it's time to
take out the trash.

06:54.795 --> 06:55.545
Hey…

06:55.629 --> 06:58.632
This thing won't come off.

06:59.550 --> 07:01.885
Hey, wait…
You guys see it, too?

07:02.302 --> 07:04.012
Just how many of you
are there?

07:04.304 --> 07:06.556
That's what I'd like to know.

07:06.640 --> 07:08.183
But the answer to that
can wait.

07:08.976 --> 07:11.812
In the meantime, I'd appreciate
you removing that lock.

07:13.147 --> 07:16.358
Hey, you goddamn punks!
Don't underestimate me!

07:16.692 --> 07:19.194
I'm not fooling around!

07:19.445 --> 07:23.945
Criminals must pay for their crimes.
That's how society works.

07:26.076 --> 07:29.788
Or what? You gonna pay
me instead of Koichi?

07:30.205 --> 07:31.581
If so, I'll let you guys go.

07:33.167 --> 07:34.877
Money's money after all!

07:35.169 --> 07:38.797
Oh? So you wanna try
and get money from me, huh?

07:38.881 --> 07:39.840
Go ahead a try, prick!

07:40.007 --> 07:43.552
Wait a second!
You just swiped 7,000 yen from me!

07:43.802 --> 07:46.387
That's for lying to me, dolt!

07:46.472 --> 07:47.181
Huh?!

07:47.264 --> 07:51.764
You think that poor kitty's life
is only worth a measly 7,000 yen?

07:52.352 --> 07:53.561
That's just not enough.

07:53.979 --> 07:55.772
You owe me
five hundred grand for that.

07:56.273 --> 07:58.024
Five hundred grand?!

07:58.484 --> 08:00.611
Yes sirree, five hun—

08:01.445 --> 08:02.737
Shut up, bitch!

08:03.489 --> 08:04.615
O-Okuyasu!

08:04.865 --> 08:06.283
Hey, control yourself.

08:06.533 --> 08:08.910
I'm tired of your bullshit, bastard!

08:09.078 --> 08:12.623
When I tell you to give his 7,000 yen
back, you give it back, douche bag!

08:26.011 --> 08:30.265
Ouch! My front tooth!

08:30.349 --> 08:34.644
Why the hell'd you stumble around
and make yourself fall over like that?

08:34.895 --> 08:37.731
Make myself fall?
You're so mean!

08:37.815 --> 08:40.651
How could you say that
after hitting me?!

08:41.860 --> 08:44.362
My front tooth's
knocked out.

08:44.446 --> 08:47.031
How could you be
so cruel?!

08:47.407 --> 08:49.450
H-Hey, wait a sec…
Are you okay?

08:49.576 --> 08:50.660
No, Okuyasu…

08:51.078 --> 08:54.498
Don't let him make you feel guilty!

08:58.919 --> 09:00.045
H-He did it on purpose!

09:01.547 --> 09:03.840
A front tooth'll cost me a lot,
you know…

09:03.924 --> 09:06.426
I don't have any insurance.

09:07.928 --> 09:09.512
Wh-Why, you…

09:09.596 --> 09:12.015
Uh oh! I wouldn't try anything
if I were you.

09:12.516 --> 09:16.186
If anyone under my
lock's control tries to hurt me,

09:16.270 --> 09:19.314
the damage will bounce
right back to the lock.

09:20.190 --> 09:22.108
Y-You bastard…

09:23.861 --> 09:27.030
Hey. That kitten you said
Koichi ran over…

09:27.531 --> 09:28.657
Would it be this thing?

09:32.744 --> 09:33.995
It was a stuffed animal?

09:35.956 --> 09:39.960
Okay, let's see.
I've got your tooth right here.

09:40.627 --> 09:41.836
There, good as new.

09:47.509 --> 09:48.384
It's gone!

09:48.635 --> 09:51.763
Hurrah!
I feel so much lighter now!

09:52.431 --> 09:53.890
Wh-Who the hell are you?!

09:54.224 --> 09:57.018
Hey, didja forget
about the 7,000 yen?

09:57.186 --> 09:59.855
All right!
I'll give it back.

10:00.355 --> 10:01.397
Put the money down,

10:01.481 --> 10:03.232
and get the hell out of here,
dumb-ass!

10:07.696 --> 10:09.656
Thank goodness… Ah!

10:10.490 --> 10:13.201
Th-The bills…
H-He took the cash!

10:13.535 --> 10:16.287
He grabbed enough of the bills
to exchange them at the bank!

10:16.496 --> 10:18.539
Th-That bastard…

10:18.790 --> 10:21.501
He's gonna pay!
And it's not even my money.

10:24.796 --> 10:27.298
Damn.
A measly 7,000 yen.

10:28.508 --> 10:31.219
Don't think
you've gotten away.

10:31.345 --> 10:32.929
I remember.

10:42.522 --> 10:43.731
Phew…

10:44.524 --> 10:49.024
That rotten morning really
ruined my whole day.

10:49.696 --> 10:51.572
I'm home, Police.

10:52.366 --> 10:54.409
Hey, you alive?
Woof, woof.

10:55.369 --> 10:56.495
I'm home.

10:56.620 --> 11:00.081
I've heard all about you,
ma'am.

11:00.332 --> 11:03.668
Beautiful, kind,
and so refined.

11:05.379 --> 11:06.421
Oh, don't be silly.

11:06.588 --> 11:08.256
I wouldn't lie!

11:08.465 --> 11:09.382
Really?

11:09.466 --> 11:11.009
Of course!

11:13.887 --> 11:18.387
<i>W- Why is this guy in my house
massaging my mom's shoulders?!</i>

11:22.312 --> 11:25.440
THE LOCK
TAMAMI KOBAYASHI

11:27.025 --> 11:27.775
Y-You!

11:27.859 --> 11:28.901
What are you doing here?!

11:29.569 --> 11:32.822
Oh, Ko, you're home. Hi!

11:33.949 --> 11:36.660
I-I s-said,
what are you doing here?!

11:37.077 --> 11:39.621
This gentleman was
kind enough

11:39.705 --> 11:41.373
to bring us the money
you dropped.

11:41.623 --> 11:42.373
Huh?!

11:42.749 --> 11:44.459
Seven thousand yen.
Mr. Forgetful.

11:44.793 --> 11:48.379
Th-This money…
You told her you found it?

11:48.714 --> 11:49.548
Of course!

11:49.965 --> 11:53.927
You ran into Mr. Kobayashi
on your bike today, didn't you?

11:54.344 --> 11:55.094
Wha…

11:55.304 --> 11:57.764
I wanted to make sure
you got your money back, Koichi.

11:57.931 --> 11:59.766
As you should!

11:59.891 --> 12:02.685
Ko, why are you getting
so upset?

12:03.103 --> 12:06.981
Ma'am,
this isn't easy for me to say,

12:08.066 --> 12:11.027
but it seems
I too dropped my wallet

12:11.111 --> 12:13.571
when Koichi hit me
with his bike.

12:13.822 --> 12:16.157
And it looks just like this one.

12:16.616 --> 12:20.494
Which means mine
was taken in place of his.

12:20.954 --> 12:23.831
Do you understand what
I'm getting at, ma'am?

12:24.249 --> 12:27.418
Well, it seems
almost inconceivable but…

12:27.502 --> 12:28.836
I suppose it's possible.

12:29.254 --> 12:33.754
So, please, ma'am, tell Koichi
to give me back my wallet.

12:35.761 --> 12:38.346
It had about
five hundred thousand yen in there.

12:38.805 --> 12:40.848
Please, tell him to give it back.

12:40.932 --> 12:42.558
What?!

12:42.726 --> 12:44.769
F-Five hundred thousand?!

12:45.145 --> 12:46.437
So he finally said it!

12:46.563 --> 12:47.564
I figured you out!

12:47.814 --> 12:49.440
K-Ko…

12:49.649 --> 12:52.401
Don't panic!
He's a fraud!

12:52.819 --> 12:54.278
— Everything he says is lies!
— Oh, that's right.

12:54.654 --> 12:59.154
I have proof
he swiped my wallet for his.

12:59.659 --> 13:03.412
Last night, I had the
hamburger meal at Jonny's.

13:03.497 --> 13:07.997
And… Oh, yeah. I added an
order of onion gratin soup…

13:08.752 --> 13:12.756
The receipt was,
let's see, 1,833 yen…

13:13.173 --> 13:16.551
It should be tucked away
somewhere in the wallet Koichi has.

13:28.480 --> 13:29.397
K-Ko!

13:29.606 --> 13:31.899
N-No! Mom,
you gotta believe me!

13:32.150 --> 13:33.276
This is a trick!

13:33.568 --> 13:34.819
You planted it on me!

13:34.986 --> 13:38.489
Then you went out
and bought the same wallet!

13:38.824 --> 13:40.450
You know,
that son of yours…

13:40.617 --> 13:44.871
I hate to say it, habit or not,
that was really quite shameful.

13:45.372 --> 13:47.791
This is the boy you raised…

13:47.916 --> 13:51.044
As his mother,
you feel no guilt?

13:51.545 --> 13:53.171
Stop!

13:58.135 --> 13:59.261
M-Mom!

14:00.387 --> 14:02.138
It finally appeared!

14:02.389 --> 14:06.601
Now the weight of her guilt
will oppress her soul.

14:06.852 --> 14:09.020
I'm gonna bleed you dry.

14:09.938 --> 14:14.317
First, I'll take this house's
land, title, and seal.

14:15.402 --> 14:17.946
What a great house
this place is.

14:20.657 --> 14:21.699
Koichi,

14:22.200 --> 14:23.284
is something wrong?

14:23.952 --> 14:24.953
Sis!

14:26.037 --> 14:27.496
Wh-What?!

14:28.707 --> 14:31.501
When she brought me
some tea,

14:31.585 --> 14:33.670
I got her to spill some
on my hand,

14:34.838 --> 14:36.673
I wailed to make her think
she burned me.

14:36.756 --> 14:38.966
She was so apologetic,
"I'm so sorry, I'm so sorry!"

14:40.218 --> 14:42.178
She was so sweet
and seductive.

14:42.429 --> 14:44.472
You said she's a junior at that
all-girls high school, right?

14:45.765 --> 14:48.058
Fully grown and ripe
for the picking.

14:49.936 --> 14:51.479
Y-Y-Yahoo!

14:58.653 --> 14:59.945
How dare you?

15:00.030 --> 15:03.158
I'll punish you!
I'll make you pay!

15:04.284 --> 15:05.785
What the hell?

15:05.911 --> 15:08.663
What is that
funny-looking egg thing?

15:19.508 --> 15:21.343
What is that?!

15:21.718 --> 15:24.470
Mom and Sis, I'll need
you to vacate the room!

15:24.638 --> 15:25.722
Ko, what in the—?

15:25.847 --> 15:27.849
I'll handle this.
I need you to be quiet!

15:28.058 --> 15:31.644
Hey! G-Get that thing
away from me!

15:31.811 --> 15:35.022
Your mom and sister
can leave the room,

15:35.148 --> 15:38.568
but they're still
my hostages!

15:44.533 --> 15:47.911
You're not getting anywhere
near my mother or sister!

15:47.994 --> 15:50.997
Do it, Koichi!
If you're so strong, then do it!

15:51.081 --> 15:53.083
Get those locks off
Mom and Sis now!

15:53.333 --> 15:57.833
If your mom sees you beating
the shit outta me,

15:58.338 --> 16:00.548
her guilt will grow
out of control!

16:00.674 --> 16:02.550
I said, get those locks off!

16:02.676 --> 16:05.345
You better respect
the great Tamami Kobayashi,

16:05.428 --> 16:07.221
you little prick of
a pipsqueak!

16:07.514 --> 16:09.807
L-Like hell
I'll remove the locks!

16:15.188 --> 16:16.564
Huh? What?

16:17.357 --> 16:18.441
That didn't hurt at all.

16:18.817 --> 16:19.567
Huh?

16:21.194 --> 16:23.237
Whoa! What was that?

16:23.530 --> 16:25.907
That's a helluva sound,
but his little fists can't do squat!

16:26.950 --> 16:29.035
What kind of Stand is that?

16:29.536 --> 16:33.998
He doesn't have
a drop of speed or power!

16:34.416 --> 16:37.585
How dare you startle me
like that, little halfwit?!

16:38.670 --> 16:39.796
I'll show you!

16:40.463 --> 16:42.465
A Stand's only
as powerful

16:42.549 --> 16:44.551
as its wielder's
mental fortitude.

16:45.385 --> 16:48.388
Which means your spirit is
feeble and weak!

16:48.555 --> 16:52.433
— You're gonna pay dearly for this!
<i>— Something's weird. His cheek!</i>

16:53.101 --> 16:54.519
<i>A "ba"and "gi"?</i>

16:54.894 --> 16:57.438
<i>It looks like
comic book sound effects.</i>

17:03.486 --> 17:06.822
Wh-What?
What's that weird ringing!

17:07.240 --> 17:09.242
It's like the sound
I heard when he hit me…

17:10.452 --> 17:13.121
What the hell is
this writing on my arm?!

17:13.913 --> 17:15.456
I-It's stuck!

17:21.212 --> 17:22.338
That can't be…

17:22.756 --> 17:26.676
These sounds seem to be
coming from inside my body!

17:27.093 --> 17:29.678
Your Stand did this?!

17:31.348 --> 17:34.476
Damn you!
Stop this noise now!

17:43.777 --> 17:44.527
It's sound.

17:44.736 --> 17:48.156
My Stand permeates
the body with sound!

17:48.782 --> 17:50.241
Wait a second,

17:50.325 --> 17:53.328
I learned a famous Matsuo Basho
poem like this at school…

17:54.287 --> 17:55.371
"Ah, the quietude—

17:55.538 --> 17:57.957
Permeating the stones,
The locusts' trill."

17:59.751 --> 18:02.378
Dammit!
He got me!

18:03.088 --> 18:05.298
Remove the locks from my
mother and sister,

18:05.382 --> 18:06.299
and the noise will stop!

18:06.466 --> 18:08.384
If you don't,

18:08.760 --> 18:11.554
who knows what might happen
to your body!

18:12.931 --> 18:14.349
Stop these sounds!

18:18.019 --> 18:20.604
Stop trying to be tough,
and remove the locks!

18:20.897 --> 18:25.397
Goddamnit!
How dare you do this to me?!

18:26.736 --> 18:28.696
You think I could swindle
and con you

18:28.780 --> 18:31.282
if I were afraid of
a pissant like you!

18:31.616 --> 18:34.076
The "Tama" in my name
stands for "balls"!

18:34.494 --> 18:36.496
You'll find out
soon enough!

18:40.667 --> 18:42.251
That knife doesn't scare me!

18:42.669 --> 18:44.253
You've underestimated me!

18:44.421 --> 18:46.798
You've never experienced
fear before!

18:46.965 --> 18:49.258
Get ready for the
pain and panic of the padlock!

18:51.136 --> 18:52.428
— Yeooow!
— What?!

18:54.347 --> 18:56.724
Ow, ow, ow, ow,
ow, ow, ow, ow!

18:57.517 --> 19:00.853
<i>The cut is shallow,
and the scream is fake!</i>

19:01.020 --> 19:01.520
Toss!

19:01.604 --> 19:02.438
"Toss"?

19:02.939 --> 19:03.731
Who's screaming?

19:04.023 --> 19:04.773
What's wrong?

19:06.359 --> 19:07.109
Ko?!

19:07.360 --> 19:08.903
This isn't…

19:11.698 --> 19:12.740
S-Shit!

19:12.907 --> 19:13.824
<i>Yes!</i>

19:16.035 --> 19:19.663
K-Ko!
How could you do this?!

19:20.206 --> 19:22.625
No, Mom!
You've got it all wrong!

19:22.709 --> 19:23.584
No!

19:24.461 --> 19:25.587
Sis!

19:25.837 --> 19:28.840
I win! You lose!

19:29.716 --> 19:32.343
Now, hurry up and
get rid of this racket, Koichi!

19:32.427 --> 19:33.928
If you don't,

19:34.179 --> 19:37.765
your mom will be
crushed by guilt!

19:39.058 --> 19:42.102
And when a person becomes
overwhelmed with guilt,

19:42.228 --> 19:44.647
death sounds
a lot better than life.

19:46.232 --> 19:49.151
T-That's it…
I can't stand it anymore!

19:49.694 --> 19:50.403
Mom!

19:50.487 --> 19:52.572
I can't live
like this anymore!

19:53.198 --> 19:54.741
Stop trying to be
so tough!

19:54.908 --> 19:57.452
Stop the sound now!
You want your mom to kill herself?!

19:57.786 --> 19:59.579
No, I won't do you the favor.

19:59.829 --> 20:02.456
In fact, I'll make it worse!

20:03.583 --> 20:04.959
Believe me!

20:05.084 --> 20:06.293
Believe me!

20:11.216 --> 20:12.133
What?!

20:13.927 --> 20:15.803
You gotta believe me,
Mom!

20:16.679 --> 20:18.597
Believe me!

20:18.848 --> 20:19.890
Mom!

20:20.391 --> 20:22.017
Believe me!

20:23.436 --> 20:26.063
<i>It all depends on a person's soul!
She'll never believe you!</i>

20:28.775 --> 20:29.525
Mom…

20:30.318 --> 20:33.904
Of course… If I, his own mother,
can't believe him,

20:34.197 --> 20:35.990
who will?

20:36.991 --> 20:39.159
Koichi's always been
an angel.

20:39.786 --> 20:43.164
He'd never hurt a soul.
He'd never steal!

20:43.706 --> 20:44.540
<i>Yes!</i>

20:45.166 --> 20:47.084
Oh no!

20:51.589 --> 20:52.423
Mom!

20:52.632 --> 20:53.841
Blast it!

20:54.133 --> 20:55.676
Parents never trust
their kids…

20:55.844 --> 20:58.471
Mine never did!

20:59.389 --> 21:00.390
Gulp…

21:05.979 --> 21:07.689
It was a joke!

21:08.982 --> 21:12.360
Ko, it was all a joke!

21:13.987 --> 21:15.822
Take the lock off
my sister, too.

21:16.030 --> 21:18.073
I already took it off!

21:18.157 --> 21:21.201
I could never do anything
to harm that beautiful face!

21:21.327 --> 21:24.872
I was only kidding
about taking your house!

21:24.956 --> 21:26.707
I even gave back
your 7,000 yen.

21:27.333 --> 21:28.709
'Member? 'member?

21:28.835 --> 21:33.130
Please forgive me!
I'll do anything, Master Koichi!

21:33.298 --> 21:35.008
Really?
You'll do anything?

21:35.216 --> 21:37.551
Yes, Master Koichi!
I'll do anything!

21:37.886 --> 21:38.887
I'll be your underling!

21:39.345 --> 21:41.096
All right, then…

21:42.307 --> 21:45.310
Make sure you bring me five
hundred grand by tomorrow.

21:48.104 --> 21:51.398
That's a joke.
Only a joke.

21:55.695 --> 21:58.864
<i>I-It sure didn't sound like it!</i>

22:02.785 --> 22:07.080
H-Hey, Okuyasu! What the hell
is this guy doing?

22:08.041 --> 22:10.251
Please give me the honor
of carrying your bag to school!

22:10.877 --> 22:12.587
You really want to carry it?

22:12.879 --> 22:14.505
Of course I do!

22:14.881 --> 22:17.425
Master Koichi!
You're a man among men!

22:17.800 --> 22:19.635
Come on,
cut that out.

22:20.345 --> 22:21.346
Hey, Okuyasu!

22:21.429 --> 22:22.805
Don't ask me!

22:22.889 --> 22:25.308
I'm not the smart one,
remember?

23:38.798 --> 23:42.009
EPISODE 7
TOSHIKAZU HAZAMADA (SHOW OFF)
